                The game

The aim of the game is to guide Billy through the
level knocking the monsters through the holes you
dig. when a monster is trapped in a hole billy can
then close it causing the monster to fall down and
disappear. some monsters are more tough than others
and need to fall several floors before they dis-
appear. if billy is not fast enough the trapped
monster will dig itself out of the hole and become
annoyed.

                 Bonusses

billy often finds things that can help him on his
journey. some of these items are points, others
have special abilities. most of them are auto-
matically collected as billy walks over them, how-
ever, some needs to be picked up. this is done by
pausing on top of the item.




    the magic ring gives points whenever billy
    jumps through a hole.

    use the ctrl-key to throw tennisballs at the
    monsters.

    the powerglove enables billy to close the
    holes faster.

    the powerdrill will quickly become one of
    billy's favourites.

    kaboooom!

    the rainbow protects billy.

    hey presto! a magic ladder. press up or down
    along with the digging key.

    the alarm clock resets the time.

    makes billy throw tennisballs harder.

    yiiippeeeee! the arcane book transforms one of
    billy's items into a permanent one.

    the trainers, the more the better.



                   controls

arrow up        billy climbs up
arrow down      billy climbs down
arrow right     billy walks to the right
arrow left      billy walks to the left
spacebar        billy digs/closes a hole
alt             billy digs/closes a hole
ctrl            billy throws a tennisball
shift           billy closes a hole
p               pauses the game
esc             ends the game and returns to the
                main menu
enter           accesses option


   

